# Thesis.md Is Read-Only

When working in this repository, treat `Thesis.md` as a read-only reference file.

## Required behavior

- You may read `Thesis.md` to extract structure, intent, and context.
- You must not modify, rewrite, format, or save changes to `Thesis.md`.
- If a request asks to edit `Thesis.md`, refuse that edit and propose editing another file instead.
